00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:19.166
HIM, EVEN IF YOU DISAGREED WITH

00:02:18.399 --> 00:02:21.769
HIM, YOU RECOGNIZE THE POWER IN

00:02:19.299 --> 00:02:22.469
US OF HIS THOUGHT, THE

00:02:21.902 --> 00:02:24.571
THOROUGHNESS OF HIS RESEARCH,

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:26.573
