00:02:24.705 --> 00:02:28.676
AND THE COMBINATION WAS STRONG.

00:02:26.707 --> 00:02:30.778
IF YOU KNOW HIM PERSONALLY, THAT

00:02:28.809 --> 00:02:31.779
WONDERFUL QUALITY HE HAD, THAT

00:02:30.911 --> 00:02:33.747
KINDNESS, GENTLENESS, GRACE.

00:02:31.912 --> 00:02:35.549
