00:02:39.486 --> 00:02:41.755
HIM AS HE PROBABLY DIDN'T ADMIRE

00:02:41.422 --> 00:02:43.190
ANYONE ELSE.

00:02:41.889 --> 00:02:46.360
I CAN'T THINK OF ANYONE THAT I

00:02:43.323 --> 00:02:47.294
ADMIRED MORE THAN I ADMIRED

00:02:46.493 --> 00:02:47.828
CHARLES KRAUTHAMMER AND DO TO

00:02:47.428 --> 00:02:49.363
